<title>USA: IPO FILING - GSR Industries Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - GSR Industries Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			GSR Industries Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			GSRI.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9-$11 shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,310,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		 Bluestone Capital Partners L.P.</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  495,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Houston, Texas company designs, manufactures and markets a full line of ashphalt-based roofing products, including premium laminated shingles, strip shingles and roll roofing products. Use of Proceeds: To pay the cash portion of the purchase price for the predecessor companies, to repay indebtedness of the founding company and predecessor companies, with the balance to be used for working capital and general corporate purposes. Financial Data in 000s: N/A.</p>
</text>
